  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 95e66c6366d904e98bc83428217d4fd7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 00 Game map - start here
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.VisualScripting.Flow::Unity.VisualScripting.ScriptGraphAsset
  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"00 Game map - start here","summary":"Every system of the game, what it does, and where it lives. Notes only: open the graphs it names.","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":620.0,"yMax":360.0},"label":"How the game is laid out","comment":"Read me first","color":{"r":0.4,"g":0.4,"b":0.4,"a":1.0},"guid":"6b10eb9f-39da-4e55-97a0-86d58fdf8aec","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":660.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":1300.0,"yMax":360.0},"label":"Ports (built)","comment":"Graphs: Ports - coming in and leaving, Ports - in port","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"5119c1c6-a169-4ee5-8a2e-75710c8e28dd","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":1340.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":1980.0,"yMax":360.0},"label":"Trade (built)","comment":"Graphs: Trade - market, Trade - markets each day","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"993dac51-a8d0-4800-8238-89540a4ef871","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2020.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":2660.0,"yMax":360.0},"label":"The map (2D, built)","comment":"Graph: Town - explore the town; [M] at sea","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"c47a4f79-cb26-41d5-9ac3-b65c9cc1e831","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2700.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":3340.0,"yMax":360.0},"label":"Voyages","comment":"To come: Graphs/Voyage","color":{"r":0.4,"g":0.4,"b":0.4,"a":1.0},"guid":"bc975395-9213-4613-890b-82041157b009","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":440.0,"xMax":620.0,"yMax":860.0},"label":"Events","comment":"To come: Graphs/Events","color":{"r":0.4,"g":0.4,"b":0.4,"a":1.0},"guid":"9a5ed95b-58cb-4553-988b-2bb86f83b77c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":660.0,"yMin":440.0,"xMax":1300.0,"yMax":860.0},"label":"Traders and encounters","comment":"To come: Graphs/Traders, Graphs/Encounters","color":{"r":0.4,"g":0.4,"b":0.4,"a":1.0},"guid":"4a5ac6e2-17a4-4879-ae0c-a0e0d671f897","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":1340.0,"yMin":440.0,"xMax":1980.0,"yMax":860.0},"label":"Reputation","comment":"To come: Graphs/Reputation","color":{"r":0.4,"g":0.4,"b":0.4,"a":1.0},"guid":"fddeeffa-371f-4a7c-92e9-eeedb47b392a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2020.0,"yMin":440.0,"xMax":2660.0,"yMax":860.0},"label":"Collectables and reading","comment":"To come: Graphs/Texts","color":{"r":0.4,"g":0.4,"b":0.4,"a":1.0},"guid":"fa9a4333-716d-4013-b862-b6d7adba59fa","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2700.0,"yMin":440.0,"xMax":3340.0,"yMax":860.0},"label":"The engine (C#, being moved to graphs)","comment":"Code/Land, Code/Sailing, Code/HDRP, Code/Weather, Code/Build","color":{"r":0.4,"g":0.4,"b":0.4,"a":1.0},"guid":"98a318f0-9696-4940-b3ee-5911c48b37c2","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":600.0,"yMax":340.0},"title":"How the game is laid out","body":"The game''s logic is in graphs on the ''--- GAME ---'' object in the world scene (W_World), one Script Machine each, and in Assets/Kapman/Game/Graphs.\n\nData the graphs read: Assets/Kapman/Game/Data (ports_793.json ... more tables as systems come).\nYour writing: Game/Data/writing.json (every text slot has a key; the game never writes story text).\n\nNodes: the game''s own are in the fuzzy finder under Kapman/ (Text, Ports, Ship...) and Events/Kapman. Everything in the game''s code is a node too (Kapman \u25b8 Graphs \u25b8 Set up visual scripting).\n\nShared state: Object variables on ''--- GAME ---'' (Docked port, Leaving...).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"de103fe7-eca8-4ab6-a1d9-da587abd955d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":680.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":1280.0,"yMax":340.0},"title":"Ports (built)","body":"Arriving: she slows inside a port''s reach -> lies to at its berth -> the port''s menu opens (text).\nCasting off: from the menu.\n\nData: Game/Data/ports_793.json (the trading places of 793).\nBlockouts: Game/Ports/{id}.prefab - plain boxes named by what they are; replace them with your models.\nIn the scene under ''--- PORTS ---'' (a WorldAnchor pins each to its place; the Port component finds its shore at the start - turn Auto Place off once you''ve placed one by hand).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"d429f4b7-5249-4f25-8d37-d89197d6c7c8","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1360.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":1960.0,"yMax":340.0},"title":"Trade (built)","body":"The goods of 793-1066: Game/Data/goods_793.json (140, each made and wanted by region, with season, weight, bulk, the law on it and its sources).\nMarkets: stock and prices from supply and demand, seasons, tolls; money: deniers, pennies, dirhams and weighed silver, each good in its own zone (Game/Data/trade_rules.json).\nThe merchant: purse, hold (the ship''s cargo), ledger of prices seen, the debt to the count.\nTo move into the 2D map view (the ''nerd side''; the 3D view is for immersion).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"2be84e8b-dc23-4d8f-9cc0-233d28d57666","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2040.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":2640.0,"yMax":340.0},"title":"The map (2D, built)","body":"Where the merchant''s business is done (the 3D is for the eye). In port, ''explore the town'' rises off the ship into the map over the town, the market docked beside it. The map is drawn from the same baked land as the 3D world (Code/Game/Map): silver sea, light land with its relief, coasts and rivers in ink; the fog of war lifting as she sails; ports; the ship. Pick a good in the market and the map marks where it''s made and wanted. To come: routes, voyage planning, traders, weather.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"baced351-8e6e-445b-950d-31ca31b26d3c","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2720.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":3320.0,"yMax":340.0},"title":"Voyages","body":"Provisions, water and ale, spare gear; seasickness, fatigue, cold and wet, injury; leaks and wear; morale - ticking with the game''s hours (On game hour).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"40268e7f-a0d3-4987-a184-5bddfd1e001e","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":500.0,"xMax":600.0,"yMax":840.0},"title":"Events","body":"Happenings at sea and in port: conditions, options (intentions) and outcomes, from a table; your text for each.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"53a74f15-9b93-4070-bc37-fdea8558e63b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":680.0,"yMin":500.0,"xMax":1280.0,"yMax":840.0},"title":"Traders and encounters","body":"Other ships with their own aims, buying and selling (prices move), carrying news. Meeting them: news of the weather ahead, a little trade; or raiders, Frankish officers, Saxons; searches for swords and captives by each realm''s law.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"dd545cd0-ca89-49bc-85fb-4b88dcd0d8ca","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1360.0,"yMin":500.0,"xMax":1960.0,"yMax":840.0},"title":"Reputation","body":"Standing with each settlement and each region, apart: trust, and moral standing by each people''s own values (slaving, raiding, piety...), spreading along the trade routes.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"bcbf9571-02b7-4a4e-a900-1b9f7ee46315","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2040.0,"yMin":500.0,"xMax":2640.0,"yMax":840.0},"title":"Collectables and reading","body":"Real texts of the time to find and read: the original and a public-domain translation (the Havamal, Bede, Alcuin''s letters of 793, the Frisian law, the Rok stone...).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"fcdcab64-5361-4316-8e10-74213fd55463","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2720.0,"yMin":500.0,"xMax":3320.0,"yMax":840.0},"title":"The engine (C#, being moved to graphs)","body":"Still C# for now, to be moved into graphs one by one after the game loop: the land (streaming the baked tiles), the sea and the ship (sailing by the wind, the wake), the weather and tides, the cameras, Build mode. Heavy inner work will stay inside single named nodes.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"2d550d21-c40f-4850-b518-448b154c19eb","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
    _objectReferences: []
